# Vantage Movers Server Organization

- This repo is the Vantage Movers Express REST API deployed on Vercel. Keep runtime API code under `api/` because `tsconfig.json` includes `api/**/*.ts`.
- `api/index.ts` owns the exported Express app, health/db probes, and route mounting. Mount versioned routes from `api/routes/`.
- `api/db.ts` is the only Mongo connection helper. Reuse it and keep the app pointed at the `vantagemovers` database.
- Put request guards in `api/middleware`, Mongoose schemas in `api/models`, orchestration/business logic in `api/services`, shared config/maps in `api/config`, helpers in `api/utils`, and Zod schemas in `api/validation`.
- Keep API payloads and Mongo fields in `snake_case`; convert to owner-facing Title Case only at the Google Sheets projection boundary.
- Keep operational scripts under `scripts/`; run them through `package.json` scripts so `.env` loading stays consistent.
- Keep planning, architecture, and workflow notes under `docs/`. Runtime code should cite those docs conceptually, not duplicate long prose from them.
- Avoid broad restructuring unless requested. Prefer small modules that match the current folder layout and the v1 API boundaries.
